  ('saas', 'SaaS & Software', 'saas', 'B2B software, workflow tools, dashboards and vertical SaaS products.', 'SaaS & Software names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on workspace, workflow, dashboard, automate, insight, report and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 30),
  ('cloud', 'Cloud & Infrastructure', 'cloud', 'Hosting, storage, networking, observability and developer infrastructure.', 'Cloud & Infrastructure names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on compute, storage, deploy, cluster, node, edge and similar terms for this industry.', 1.05, true, 40),
  ('developer-tools', 'Developer Tools', 'developer-tools', 'SDKs, CI/CD, testing, code review, terminals and API platforms.', 'Developer Tools names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on commit, branch, merge, build, deploy, debug and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 50),
  ('ecommerce', 'E-commerce & Retail', 'ecommerce', 'Online stores, marketplaces, checkout, dropshipping and retail brands.', 'E-commerce & Retail names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on cart, checkout, catalog, order, fulfil, inventory and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 60),
  ('real-estate', 'Real Estate & Property', 'real-estate', 'Property listings, rentals, proptech, interiors and home services.', 'Real Estate & Property names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on property, estate, realty, dwelling, abode, nest and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 70),
  ('health', 'Health & Wellness', 'health', 'Clinical tools, telehealth, wellness, fitness and mental health.', 'Health & Wellness names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on care, clinic, vital, recovery, therapy, balance and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 80),
  ('education', 'Education & Learning', 'education', 'Schools, courses, tutoring, assessment and corporate learning.', 'Education & Learning names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on academy, course, lesson, study, tutor, campus and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 90),
  ('travel', 'Travel & Hospitality', 'travel', 'Booking, itineraries, stays, flights and experiences.', 'Travel & Hospitality names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on journey, voyage, route, itinerary, destination, stay and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 100),
  ('food', 'Food & Beverage', 'food', 'Restaurants, delivery, recipes, hospitality supply and food brands.', 'Food & Beverage names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on kitchen, table, plate, harvest, spice, brew and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 110),
  ('marketing', 'Marketing & Growth', 'marketing', 'SEO, content, advertising, CRM, email and analytics platforms.', 'Marketing & Growth names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on campaign, audience, funnel, brand, reach, engage and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 120),
  ('communication', 'Communication & Messaging', 'communication', 'Chat, email, voice, video, notifications and team collaboration tools.', 'Communication & Messaging names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on chat, inbox, thread, channel, room, call and similar terms for this industry.', 1.02, true, 130),
  ('automation', 'Automation & Workflows', 'automation', 'Workflow automation, scheduling, integrations, no-code tools and background jobs.', 'Automation & Workflows names work best when the vocabulary of the domain is recognisable at a glance. The engine draws on flow, trigger, task, queue, schedule, batch and similar terms for this industry.', 1, true, 140),
